        text: 'Kecksburg residents interviewed over four decades describe an object shaped like an acorn and about the size of a Volkswagen bearing writing resembling hieroglyphs, removed from the woods by a military operation; resident John Hays has stated since 1990 that as a ten-year-old he saw a flat-bed truck emerging from the site carrying something \'the size of a VW\'.',
        source: 'Unsolved Mysteries (NBC, 1990); \'The New Roswell: Kecksburg Exposed\' (Sci Fi Channel, 2003)'
