        tier: 1,
        text: 'The released DIRD reproduces at Appendix B the underlying conference paper "The Statistical Drake Equation" with the byline intact, reading "Claudio Macc[one], Co-Vice Chair, SETI Permanent Study Group, International Academy of Astronautics", corroborating the DIA list attribution from inside the document itself even though the cover author block is redacted under (b)(6). OCR of the scan is degraded; the surname renders as "Maccolle" and SETI as "SHTI".',
